Relevant tables / columns for the task  
(Only those needed to build the required vectors and to return the final result)

• WORD_VECTORS_US.WORD_VECTORS_US.NATURE  
  – "id": unique identifier – returned in final list  
  – "date": article date – returned in final list  
  – "title": article title – returned in final list  
  – "body": full‑text on which all vector calculations will be done  
  – (optional) "category", "keywords" – can be used for quick filtering while testing

• WORD_VECTORS_US.WORD_VECTORS_US.WORD_FREQUENCIES  
  – "word": token text – required to fetch its overall frequency  
  – "frequency": corpus frequency – used to weight each GloVe dimension  
  – (condition) WHERE "word" = :token   or  WHERE "word" IN (…) to pull a batch

• WORD_VECTORS_US.WORD_VECTORS_US.GLOVE_VECTORS  
  – "word": token text – join key to a GloVe 300‑dim vector  
  – "vector": 300‑dim Variant – converted to ARRAY/FLOAT later for math  
  – (condition) WHERE "word" = :token   or  WHERE "word" IN (…) for batch load


